"Bitmap describing which methods of Dynamic Address Assignment from a Static "
"Address are supported by this I3C Target. A value of 1 in a bit position "
"indicates that the I3C target supports that method, and a value of 0 "
"indicates that the I3C target does not support that method. Bit 0: SETDASA "
"Bit 1: SETAASA All other bits are reserved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../driver-api/i3c/master-driver-api:9:
#: ../include/linux/i3c/master.h:185
msgid "``pid``"
msgstr ""

